      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 12.238 million for 2023. This was primarily driven by favourable claims development in Accident & Health (GBP 15.1m release), Discontinued (GBP 9.3m release), Marine (GBP 1.3m release), and Energy (GBP 0.9m release). These favourable movements were partially offset by an adverse development in Casualty (GBP 14.4m strengthening). The Loss Portfolio Transfer (LPT) transaction, effective June 30, 2023, covering 2021 and prior underwriting years, also contributed to the reserve movements. Claims inflation, impacted by higher energy prices and supply chain issues, continued to be a factor, with additional IBNR held for excess claims inflation.",
